			'post_type'      => 'bb_lead',
			'title'          => $phone,
			'post_status'    => 'any',
			'posts_per_page' => 1,
			'fields'         => 'ids',
		)
	);
	if ( $ids ) {
		return (int) $ids[0];
	}
	if ( ! $create ) {
		return 0;
	}
	return (int) wp_insert_post(
		array(
			'post_type'   => 'bb_lead',
			'post_title'  => $phone,
			'post_status' => 'publish',
		)
	);
}

/** Save what the customer has typed at checkout (keyed by WhatsApp number). */
function bb_ajax_capture() {
	// phpcs:disable WordPress.Security.NonceVerification.Missing -- public checkout capture; rate limited.
	$phone = bb_normalize_phone( isset( $_POST['phone'] ) ? sanitize_text_field( wp_unslash( $_POST['phone'] ) ) : '' );
	if ( strlen( $phone ) < 10 || strlen( $phone ) > 13 ) {
		wp_send_json_error();
	}
	$ip  = isset( $_SERVER['REMOTE_ADDR'] ) ? sanitize_text_field( wp_unslash( $_SERVER['REMOTE_ADDR'] ) ) : 'x';
	$key = 'bb_cap_' . md5( $ip );
	$hit = (int) get_transient( $key );
	if ( $hit > 60 ) {
		wp_send_json_error();
	}
	set_transient( $key, $hit + 1, HOUR_IN_SECONDS );

	$id = bb_lead_for_phone( $phone );
	if ( ! $id ) {
		wp_send_json_error();
	}
	$map = array(
		'name'     => 'billing_first_name',
		'email'    => 'billing_email',
		'address'  => 'billing_address_1',
		'postcode' => 'billing_postcode',
		'city'     => 'billing_city',
		'state'    => 'billing_state',
	);
	foreach ( $map as $meta => $field ) {
		if ( isset( $_POST[ $field ] ) ) {
			$val = 'billing_email' === $field ? sanitize_email( wp_unslash( $_POST[ $field ] ) ) : sanitize_text_field( wp_unslash( $_POST[ $field ] ) );
			if ( '' !== $val ) {
				update_post_meta( $id, '_bb_' . $meta, $val );
			}
		}
	}
	// phpcs:enable
	if ( WC()->cart && ! WC()->cart->is_empty() ) {
		$bits = array();
		foreach ( WC()->cart->get_cart() as $item ) {
			$bits[] = $item['data']->get_name() . ' ×' . $item['quantity'];
		}
		update_post_meta( $id, '_bb_bag', implode( ', ', $bits ) . ' · ' . wp_strip_all_tags( WC()->cart->get_total() ) );
	}
	if ( 'ordered' !== get_post_meta( $id, '_bb_status', true ) ) {
		update_post_meta( $id, '_bb_status', 'checkout' );
	}
	update_post_meta( $id, '_bb_seen', current_time( 'mysql' ) );
	if ( WC()->session ) {
		WC()->session->set( 'bb_lead_id', $id );
	}
	wp_send_json_success();
}
add_action( 'wp_ajax_bb_capture', 'bb_ajax_capture' );
add_action( 'wp_ajax_nopriv_bb_capture', 'bb_ajax_capture' );

/** Mark the lead as ordered once the order is placed. */
add_action(
	'woocommerce_checkout_order_processed',
	function ( $order_id ) {
		$order = wc_get_order( $order_id );
		if ( ! $order ) {
			return;
		}
		$phone = bb_normalize_phone( $order->get_billing_phone() );
		if ( strlen( $phone ) < 10 ) {
			return;
		}
		$id = bb_lead_for_phone( $phone );
		if ( $id ) {
			update_post_meta( $id, '_bb_status', 'ordered' );
			update_post_meta( $id, '_bb_order', $order->get_order_number() );
			update_post_meta( $id, '_bb_name', $order->get_billing_first_name() );
		}
	}
);

/** Short privacy note under the checkout form. */
add_action(
	'woocommerce_after_checkout_billing_form',
	function () {
		echo '<p class="bb-small" style="margin:8px 0 0">' . esc_html__( 'We save your details as you type so you can finish your order later, and on this device for faster checkout next time.', 'bunnybabe' ) . '</p>';
	}
);
